### putUser
PUT http://localhost:4000/users?age=30&city=Kathmandu HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "kamal@example.com",
    "password": "Password123"
}

### deleteUser
DELETE http://localhost:4000/users HTTP/1.1
